WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.651
Bloom was watching a Cooltube video.

2
00:00:14.671 --> 00:00:17.372
"Hey, folks!"

3
00:00:18.013 --> 00:00:18.813
a young woman said.

4
00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:20.474
"I'm Pam!"

5
00:00:21.215 --> 00:00:22.155
"I'm Cam!"

6
00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:23.236
her twin said.

7
00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:28.058
"And we're the Tattle Twins—your favorite new Cooltubers!"

8
00:00:29.199 --> 00:00:30.320
Pam looked serious.

9
00:00:31.184 --> 00:00:33.766
"We have a shocking video for you.

10
00:00:34.307 --> 00:00:35.708
Check it out."

11
00:00:36.649 --> 00:00:38.250
Mayor Bloom saw two dented cars.

12
00:00:39.391 --> 00:00:42.214
Whiz-hoo! Lasers blew up one car.

13
00:00:42.594 --> 00:00:45.196
Ka-boom! The camera zoomed out.

14
00:00:45.797 --> 00:00:47.398
Rocket Girl and Detective Smith were there.

15
00:00:48.038 --> 00:00:48.819
They were laughing.

16
00:00:52.182 --> 00:00:53.363
Mayor Bloom gasped.

17
00:00:53.383 --> 00:00:55.345
"That's terrible!"

18
00:00:55.365 --> 00:00:59.008
"There you have it, folks," Pam said.

19
00:00:59.928 --> 00:01:02.670
"Rocket Girl is a bad guy!"

20
00:01:03.551 --> 00:01:04.291
Cam grinned.

21
00:01:04.311 --> 00:01:06.813
"We hope you liked this video.

22
00:01:07.013 --> 00:01:10.115
If so, please subscribe to our channel!"

23
00:01:10.135 --> 00:01:14.879
"I love this play," Mara said.

24
00:01:14.899 --> 00:01:16.860
"It's so funny!"

25
00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:19.722
Roxy and her friends were at an outdoor theater.

26
00:01:21.183 --> 00:01:23.645
The audience clapped as two actors left the stage.

27
00:01:25.366 --> 00:01:26.667
Terrell looked at his program.

28
00:01:26.687 --> 00:01:28.348
"There's an intermission now."

29
00:01:29.164 --> 00:01:30.065
Jack's phone beeped.

30
00:01:30.085 --> 00:01:35.187
"Oh! The Tattle Twins just posted a new video."

31
00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:37.769
"They're the new Cooltube stars, right?"

32
00:01:38.109 --> 00:01:38.750
Roxy said.

33
00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:40.370
Terrell nodded.

34
00:01:40.931 --> 00:01:43.652
"They catch people doing bad things and breaking rules.

35
00:01:44.593 --> 00:01:47.134
Last week some teenagers went into Metro Mart.

36
00:01:47.675 --> 00:01:48.995
They tried to steal donuts.

37
00:01:49.716 --> 00:01:51.957
The Tattle Twins recorded the whole thing!"

38
00:01:53.298 --> 00:01:54.018
Jack chuckled.

39
00:01:54.038 --> 00:01:56.980
"I liked the video they made in the theater.

40
00:01:57.812 --> 00:02:00.073
They caught people texting during a movie."

41
00:02:00.093 --> 00:02:03.814
"Remember the video with the Mighty Man actor?"

42
00:02:04.214 --> 00:02:04.914
Terrell asked.

43
00:02:06.074 --> 00:02:07.955
"He was really rude to that waitress.

44
00:02:09.115 --> 00:02:10.535
He had to apologize to her."

45
00:02:12.476 --> 00:02:13.456
Jack pressed Play.

46
00:02:14.317 --> 00:02:16.377
His friends leaned in to watch the new video.

47
00:02:17.197 --> 00:02:18.218
The car blew up.

48
00:02:20.838 --> 00:02:21.979
The camera zoomed out.

49
00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.340
Jack gasped.

50
00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.181
"Rocket Girl blew up a car!"

51
00:02:29.201 --> 00:02:32.782
"She's laughing," Mara said.

52
00:02:33.783 --> 00:02:35.183
Terrell glanced at Roxy.

53
00:02:35.804 --> 00:02:37.104
Roxy's face grew hot.

54
00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:38.965
She knew the video was fake.

55
00:02:39.405 --> 00:02:40.826
But she didn't know what to say.

56
00:02:41.906 --> 00:02:42.786
Mara shook her head.

57
00:02:42.806 --> 00:02:44.667
"I don't understand.

58
00:02:45.227 --> 00:02:46.668
Rocket Girl wouldn't do that.

59
00:02:47.288 --> 00:02:48.529
She helps people."

60
00:02:49.789 --> 00:02:50.230
"I know."

61
00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:52.110
Jack scratched his head.

62
00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.971
"But it's on video.

63
00:02:54.671 --> 00:02:55.852
How do you explain that?"

64
00:02:56.784 --> 00:02:57.924
"The video is fake."

65
00:02:58.345 --> 00:02:59.405
Terrell looked angry.

66
00:02:59.425 --> 00:03:02.206
"The Tattle Twins are framing Rocket Girl.

67
00:03:02.986 --> 00:03:04.106
I don't like them anymore."

68
00:03:05.006 --> 00:03:06.007
Roxy felt sick.

69
00:03:06.587 --> 00:03:08.267
Why would the Tattle Twins frame her?

70
00:03:09.368 --> 00:03:10.088
Her watch beeped.

71
00:03:10.108 --> 00:03:13.689
"I can't worry about this right now," Roxy thought.

72
00:03:14.149 --> 00:03:15.329
"Mayor Bloom needs me."

73
00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:20.691
She moved away from her friends and took a deep breath.

74
00:03:24.732 --> 00:03:27.961
Bloom." "Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

75
00:03:27.981 --> 00:03:31.843
"There's an emergency at Police Headquarters.

76
00:03:32.563 --> 00:03:33.343
They need your help."

77
00:03:33.363 --> 00:03:36.705
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

78
00:03:36.725 --> 00:03:38.866
"I'm on my way!"
